
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>The Archive</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: Georgia, serif;
            color: #e8d9b5;
            background:
                linear-gradient(rgba(15, 12, 10, 0.78),
                                rgba(15, 12, 10, 0.9)),
                url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518709268805-4e9042af9f23")
                center/cover fixed;
        }

        /* Navigation */

        nav {
            padding: 20px 40px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            background: rgba(15, 12, 10, 0.85);
            border-bottom: 1px solid #705b3e;
        }

        nav a {
            color: #d7bd8b;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: white;
        }

        /* Archive heading */

        .heading {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 55px 20px 35px;
        }

        .heading h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            letter-spacing: 7px;
            color: #d7bd8b;
            text-shadow: 2px 3px 8px black;
        }

        .heading p {
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-size: 17px;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #c2ae88;
        }

        /* Door layout */

        .doors {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 30px auto 70px;
            padding: 20px;

            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 35px;
        }

        /* Individual doors */

        .door {
            height: 360px;
            position: relative;

            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;

            text-decoration: none;
            text-align: center;

            background:
                linear-gradient(rgba(30, 17, 10, 0.2),
                                rgba(30, 17, 10, 0.55)),
                repeating-linear-gradient(
                    90deg,
                    #382115 0px,
                    #543522 12px,
                    #3a2417 24px,
                    #69442a 38px
                );

            border: 9px solid #21150e;
            outline: 2px solid #927347;
            outline-offset: -16px;

            box-shadow:
                0 12px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.7),
                inset 0 0 30px black;

            transition: transform 0.3s, filter 0.3s;
        }

        .door:hover {
            transform: scale(1.04);
            filter: brightness(1.25);
        }

        /* Door details */

        .door::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #c5a45e;
            top: 50%;
            right: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px #d4a64c;
        }

        .door-content {
            padding: 20px;
            background: rgba(15, 10, 7, 0.7);
            border: 1px solid #a88a56;
            width: 75%;
        }

        .door h2 {
            color: #e4c995;
            font-size: 26px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .door p {
            color: #d2c2a3;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* Footer */

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
            background: rgba(15, 12, 10, 0.85);
            border-top: 1px solid #705b3e;
            color: #a99778;
        }

        /* Mobile */

        @media (max-width: 650px) {
            .doors {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                max-width: 420px;
            }

            .heading h1 {
                font-size: 34px;
            }

            .door {
                height: 300px;
            }
        }

    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <nav>
        <a href="index.html">← Return Home</a>
        <span>Personal Archive</span>
    </nav>

    <section class="heading">

        <h1>THE ARCHIVE</h1>

        <p>
            "Not all knowledge is meant to be remembered.
            Not all history is meant to be known."
        </p>

    </section>

    <section class="doors">

        <a href="archive/history.html" class="door">
            <div class="door-content">
                <h2>World History</h2>
                <p>
                    Kingdoms, ancient civilizations,
                    forgotten histories and the world itself.
                </p>
            </div>
        </a>

        <a href="archive/factions.html" class="door">
            <div class="door-content">
                <h2>Factions & Orders</h2>
                <p>
                    Organizations, political powers,
                    secret societies and rival factions.
                </p>
            </div>
        </a>

        <a href="archive/characters.html" class="door">
            <div class="door-content">
                <h2>Characters</h2>
                <p>
                    Heroes, villains, important figures
                    and the people who shape history.
                </p>
            </div>
        </a>

        <a href="archive/campaigns.html" class="door">
            <div class="door-content">
                <h2>Campaigns & Adventures</h2>
                <p>
                    Stories, encounters, adventures
                    and the events of the realm.
                </p>
            </div>
        </a>

    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>THE ARCHIVE | All records preserved, or so it is claimed.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>

